e('DPDK can process tens of millions of packets a second per core. The costs are real:','Without a specified benchmark, no per-core packet rate is asserted. For the exclusive busy-poll model, costs include:','Unverifiedthroughputremoved.',dp)
e('DPDK is the standard choice for virtual switches (Open vSwitch with DPDK), telecom packet cores and software routers.','DPDK is used in several packet-processing domains. Bifurcated drivers can coexist with a kernel driver, and power-saving/interrupt modes can change the exclusive busy-poll tradeoffs above.','DPDKnotuniversaldedication.',dp)
